{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108289","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108289/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108289/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108289/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108289","id":3203445243,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6-8LH7","number":108289,"title":"Meshes baked from CSG nodes always have smooth normals (regression)","user":{"login":"fragskye","id":199886693,"node_id":"U_kgDOC-oHZQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199886693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye","html_url":"https://github.com/fragskye","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-04T18:21:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T15:22:46Z","closed_at":"2025-07-04T20:04:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.dev [2887545], 4.5.beta1, 4.5.beta2.\n- Not reproducible in: 4.5.dev [318a817], 4.5.dev5, 4.4.1.stable.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta1 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7296) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-11700K @ 3.60GHz (16 threads) - 63.74 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe normals on any meshes generated by CSG > Bake Mesh Instance are smooth shaded. This happens on any CSG node, including `CSGCombiner3D`.\n\nThis appears to have been caused by commit `2887545`, which changed the implementation of `CSGShape3D::bake_static_mesh` to create an optimized version of its mesh using `SurfaceTool`. However, it re-calculates normals while taking into account smoothing groups, which seem to be all set to the same value (?). When testing a fix, you'd probably want to check using `CSGCylinder3D`, since that's the only CSG node that has smooth and flat surfaces by default.\n\nExpected result (4.5.dev5 and earlier):\n\n<img width=\"640\" height=\"350\" alt=\"A box that is entirely flat-shaded\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b0ff1bf-213f-42c1-a103-bfa0d6a364df\" />\n\n<img width=\"640\" height=\"350\" alt=\"A cylinder with flat-shaded faces at its top and bottom\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/053980ea-9b1d-4819-b7ab-6f3e9d215827\" />\n\nActual result (4.5.beta1 and later):\n\n<img width=\"640\" height=\"350\" alt=\"A box that is entirely smooth-shaded\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dae970e4-6da6-49bc-9633-74f520072774\" />\n\n<img width=\"640\" height=\"350\" alt=\"A cylinder that is entirely smooth-shaded\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aff5ce98-d34d-46bf-8125-88e7512d7e00\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a `CSGBox3D` to a scene, or any other CSG node which normally has sharp edges, such as the top and bottom of a `CSGCylinder3D`.\n2. Through the CSG menu at the top of the 3D editor viewport, select Bake Mesh Instance.\n3. Hide the original CSG node. The entire baked mesh will have smooth shaded normals, causing severe lighting issues on faces intended to be flat.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp-csg-baked-normals.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21064904/mrp-csg-baked-normals.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108289/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108289/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}